OL,3,GNEWSABrutal crypto attack on couple
OL,4,Aprompts #10k reward
OL,5,
OL,6,FA young couple were violently attacked
OL,7,Fin their home and forced to hand over a
OL,8,Flarge sum of cryptocurrency by masked
OL,9,Fthieves who pushed their way in.
OL,11,FThe couple, who were expecting their
OL,12,Fthird baby at the time, were assaulted
OL,13,Fand threatened after returning home to
OL,14,FSmith's Wood in Solihull at about 17:20
OL,15,FGMT on Saturday 13 December 2025,
OL,16,Fpolice said.
OL,18,FAs they opened their front door, three
OL,19,Fmen got out of a parked car and pushed
OL,20,Finto the house behind them.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
